# POLLY, chords: entering chords on the Chords page. A rolled four-note chord is one chord (the cursor moves on
# when the keys are up); the song comes back after a template audition; one REC at a time, CHORD restored; a
# chord growing while recorded rewrites its beat; past the end of a song that does not loop, dropped; a song
# waiting for the bar line takes a chord at its bar 1.
wait 300
tap LFO
tap SEL
expect chord_mode 1
key 4 down
wait 20
key 7 down
wait 20
key 11 down
wait 20
key 14 down
wait 50
expect song_chord0 918
expect song_chord4 26
expect cbeat 0
key 4 up
key 7 up
key 11 up
key 14 up
wait 30
expect cbeat 4
expect song_chord4 26
# voice leading: C E G, then G lifted and A added with C E held: C, then Am at the next step
key 7 down
key 11 down
key 14 down
wait 30
expect song_chord4 0
key 14 up
wait 20
key 16 down
wait 30
expect song_chord4 0
expect song_chord8 916
expect cbeat 8
key 7 up
key 11 up
key 16 up
wait 30
expect cbeat 12
tap SEL
expect chord_mode 0
# a template auditioned; leaving the Templates pages gives the song back
tap ARP
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect template 0
expect song_on 0
tap PLAY
wait 100
tap LFO
expect song_on 1
# REC: the track's recording first, then REC on Chords: it ends the track's, turns CHORD on
tap SEQ
tap PLAY
tap REC
expect recording 1
tap LFO
tap REC
wait 50
expect recording 0
expect rec_chords 1
expect chord_mode 1
# A C E then G, held, around beat 3: Am7 on that beat, nothing after it
wait 600
key 4 down
key 7 down
key 11 down
wait 30
key 14 down
wait 30
expect cbeat 2
expect cur_chord 918
expect song_chord3 26
shot rec_grow.png
key 4 up
key 7 up
key 11 up
key 14 up
wait 30
# leaving the page: chord recording off, CHORD as it was
tap HOME
expect rec_chords 0
expect chord_mode 0
tap PLAY
wait 100
# a song of one bar that does not loop: a chord in the second half of its last beat is dropped
tap ENV
spin K2 -2
spin K3 -1
expect song_bars 1
tap LFO
tap PLAY
tap REC
wait 1650
key 9 down
key 12 down
key 16 down
wait 30
expect song_chord0 918
key 9 up
key 12 up
key 16 up
tap REC
wait 300
expect playing 0
# a song set while a template plays waits for the bar line: a chord played meanwhile goes to its bar 1
tap ARP
tap PLAY
wait 300
tap LFO
tap REC
wait 30
key 7 down
key 11 down
key 14 down
wait 30
expect song_chord0 0
expect cbeat 0
key 7 up
key 11 up
key 14 up
tap REC
tap PLAY
shot chords_end.png
